# =============================================================================
# PRAVAH - Environment Configuration
# =============================================================================

# --- Supabase Cloud Database & Realtime WebSocket Bus (Recommended for Multi-User / Vercel) ---
# When deployed to Vercel or shared across multiple users/devices, Supabase synchronizes:
# 1. Citizen & Officer Ground Incidents
# 2. Real-time Upvotes, Downvotes & Confidence Score recalculations
# 3. Photo proof submissions & Clearance updates
# 4. Corridor disruptions & road blockages
# 5. Convoy Driver Emergency SOS broadcasts to Central Dispatch
#
# Obtain these free credentials from https://supabase.com:
# Project Settings -> API -> Project URL & anon/public Key
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your-anon-key-here

# Note: If these keys are omitted, PRAVAH automatically operates in offline-first mode
# using browser localStorage and the local Node.js server (http://localhost:3001).
